        <mxCell id="note1" value="API Gateway ≠ EnrollmentFacade: the gateway is an architectural pattern doing infrastructure-level routing across services; EnrollmentFacade is a class-level GoF structural pattern inside the Enrollment Service business tier. Complementary — not the same thing. Call order inside enroll(): validate → run saga steps → save enrollment → publish EnrollmentConfirmed." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=#B09500;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
